# Trends Module Structure

- API routes: `backend/app/api/routes/trends/`
  - route file: `trends.py` (expects `router = APIRouter(...)`)
  - router is wired from `backend/app/main.py` via `from app.api.routes.trends import trends`
- Models: `backend/app/models/trends/`
- Schemas: `backend/app/schemas/trends/`
- Services: `backend/app/services/trends/`
  - create only when trends logic grows beyond DB queries + caching inside routes
- Shared helpers: `backend/app/utils/` (only cross-cutting)

